---
source: tests/golden.rs
---
  x mode for `/etc/duplicate.conf` is declared twice
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-overlay/modules/core/bad-modes/module.kdl:12:1]
 11 | mode "/etc/duplicate.conf" "0440"
 12 | mode "/etc/duplicate.conf" "0600"
    : ^^|^
    :   `-- already declared above
 13 | mode "/etc/missing.conf" "0440"
    `----

  x `etc/relative.conf` is not a normal absolute overlay path
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-overlay/modules/core/bad-modes/module.kdl:7:6]
 6 | 
 7 | mode "etc/relative.conf" "0440"
   :      ^^^^^^^^^|^^^^^^^^^
   :               `-- not a file path under `files/`
 8 | mode "/etc/non-octal.conf" "0880"
   `----
  help: name the path exactly as it lands in the image, such as `/etc/
        example.conf`

  x `0880` is not an octal file mode
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-overlay/modules/core/bad-modes/module.kdl:8:28]
 7 | mode "etc/relative.conf" "0440"
 8 | mode "/etc/non-octal.conf" "0880"
   :                            ^^^|^^
   :                               `-- use only digits 0 through 7
 9 | mode "/etc/out-of-range.conf" "10000"
   `----
  help: a chmod file mode such as `0440`

  x file mode `10000` is out of range
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-overlay/modules/core/bad-modes/module.kdl:9:31]
  8 | mode "/etc/non-octal.conf" "0880"
  9 | mode "/etc/out-of-range.conf" "10000"
    :                               ^^^|^^^
    :                                  `-- greater than 07777
 10 | mode "/etc/empty.conf" ""
    `----

  x `` is not an octal file mode
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-overlay/modules/core/bad-modes/module.kdl:10:24]
  9 | mode "/etc/out-of-range.conf" "10000"
 10 | mode "/etc/empty.conf" ""
    :                        ^|
    :                         `-- use only digits 0 through 7
 11 | mode "/etc/duplicate.conf" "0440"
    `----
  help: a chmod file mode such as `0440`

  x `core/bad-modes` declares a mode for a file it does not ship
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-overlay/modules/core/bad-modes/module.kdl:13:6]
 12 | mode "/etc/duplicate.conf" "0600"
 13 | mode "/etc/missing.conf" "0440"
    :      ^^^^^^^^^|^^^^^^^^^
    :               `-- /etc/missing.conf is missing from every `files/`
    `----
  help: shipping the overlay file is what makes its mode meaningful

  x `core/second` overwrites `/etc/sudoers.d/99-hardening`, which `core/first`
  | also ships
  help: overlays are copied in build order, so this one wins and the other
        file never reaches the image. Rename one of the two, or declare
        `overrides "/etc/sudoers.d/99-hardening"` here if replacing it is the
        point

  x `core/third` overrides `/usr/lib/nothing.conf`, which no earlier module
  | ships
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-overlay/modules/core/third/module.kdl:7:1]
 6 | 
 7 | overrides "/usr/lib/nothing.conf"
   : ^^^^|^^^^
   :     `-- nothing to replace
   `----
  help: an override is checked, so it cannot outlive the collision it was
        added for; drop it, or check the path against what the other module
        actually ships
